  "body": "Exposing PromiseRejectionEvent in Shadow Realms doesn't make much sense, since the global isn't an EventTarget.\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#unhandled-promise-rejections just doesn't work with that kind of globals.\r\nAnd https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#report-the-exception doesn't really work either, again because the global isn't an EventTarget.",
